    fix(tests): bounded-retry rm in perf001 teardown — ENOTEMPTY git-flush race
    
    The afterEach rmSync raced the async autocommitter post-drain git flush on
    <ns>/.git (CI run 37534212904), redding main on a docs-only close. Same
    class as DB-GAP-063 teardown flake; fix per pre-verified off-by-one class
    1515 (bounded-retry rm, no assertion/product change).
    
